    <expertiseList>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/2fd6c824c6774465bde3c38988825648"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/7c559ecef28f4dacade79bdf7eb54782"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/4ebf57d8f29a4479ab12e0cf566ce62c"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/2fd6c824c6774465bde3c38988825648","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Geotechnical Investigations"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/7c559ecef28f4dacade79bdf7eb54782","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Concrete Testing and Investigations"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/4ebf57d8f29a4479ab12e0cf566ce62c","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Soil Testing and Investigations"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/a8af6654935c43f1a3a646c07c6969ce","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/a8af6654935c43f1a3a646c07c6969ce","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“These projects are, as I mentioned, very close to my heart. I get to experience and be a part of the \u003cbr\u003edevelopment that’s happening in my home town and in areas I grew up around. It’s very special.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this mission in mind, we are thrilled to announce the latest addition to our laboratory equipment lineup: \u003cbr\u003ethe Mastersizer 3000E from Malvern Panalytical. We are the only commercial facility with this capacity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/dcldwyz1/polokwane-2.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe City Centre, Polokwane\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eA new signalised intersection in Seshego\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Seshego is my home town, so it’s especially\u003cbr\u003erewarding to be working here.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe are providing soil testing and nuclear densities\u003cbr\u003efor this project on  Nelson Mandela Drive, Seshego.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis will enable the upgrading an existing 5-\u003cbr\u003elegged round-about into a new signalised 4-\u003cbr\u003elegged intersection that improves driver safety.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/aqddca1m/b.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eOur Technical Journey\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_inlineleft  td_uid_12_633d70de2eeea_rand td_block_template_1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"td-visible-desktop\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"beacon_1c824f1e1b\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 0px; visibility: hidden;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px;\" src=\"https://ads-za.privatelabel.co.za/www/delivery/lg.php?bannerid=1428\u0026amp;campaignid=218\u0026amp;zoneid=32\u0026amp;loc=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.miningmx.com%2Fnews%2Fbase-metals%2F49235-vedanta-approves-r7bn-project-to-double-up-zinc-from-gamsberg-facilities-in-northern-cape%2F\u0026amp;referer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2F\u0026amp;cb=1c824f1e1b\" alt=\"\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy harnessing the capabilities of this advanced particle size analyzer, we are poised to deliver superior results and exceed the expectations of our clients across diverse industries.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe remain dedicated to pushing the boundaries of laboratory testing and setting new benchmarks for quality, accuracy, and customer satisfaction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay tuned as we continue to leverage cutting-edge technologies to drive positive impact and create unmatched value for our clients.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cem\u003e- Janco Potgieter, Group Technical Manager\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/vwmbvrbe/janco.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eHow Will It Benefit Roadlab Clients?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAggregate Testing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn the field of aggregate testing, accurate particle size analysis is crucial for evaluating the quality and performance of construction materials. With the Mastersizer 3000E, we can much more precisely determine the particle size distribution of aggregates, helping our clients make informed decisions regarding material selection and optimization.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSoil Characterization\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn soil characterization efforts, understanding the particle size distribution is essential for assessing soil stability. By employing the Mastersizer 3000E, we can conduct thorough soil analysis with unmatched precision, providing valuable insights for environmental, engineering and construction projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuality Control\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn addition to specific applications, the Mastersizer 3000E will play a pivotal role in our quality control processes across various testing procedures. This instrument will enable us to maintain stringent quality standards and ensure compliance with regulatory requirements.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eInterested in our work?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eReach out to us.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>Roadlab is an accomplished supporter of over 400 construction companies and 60 consulting firms. Our particle size analysis capabilities enable us to support their aggregate, soils and quality control needs.</p>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
